1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
全国最能吃辣第一名，是江西
China's spiciest province? Jiangxi.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,900
不是四川，不是湖南
Not Sichuan. Not Hunan.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,400
江西的辣，最"纯"
Jiangxi's heat is the purest.

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,900
不加麻、不加糖，只有辣
No numbing, no sugar — just heat.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,400
萍乡，被叫江西辣的天花板
Pingxiang: the ceiling of it all.

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,900
一碗炒粉，辣椒比粉还多
A bowl of fried noodles, more chili than noodles.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,400
炒青菜放辣椒，煮汤也放
Chili in the greens, chili in the soup.

8
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,900
红辣椒炒青辣椒，是道菜
"Chili stir-fried with chili" — a real dish.

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,400
低调，却辣得没有退路
Quiet province, no escape from the heat.

10
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,900
最后一站，去云南
Last stop: Yunnan. Next part.

11
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,600
你敢挑战萍乡炒粉吗？评论区
Dare to try Pingxiang noodles? Comment.
